.5, 'explanation': 'Citation format is valid but not found in searched databases', 'context': 'lement to paid military leave under subsection .060(1). Last, Bearden requests an award of attorney fees and expenses should he prevail on the certified question. RAP 18.1(a) (permitting such an award “[i]f applicable law grants to a party the right to recover reasonable attorney fees or expenses on review” before this court). USERRA permits an employee to recover reasonable attorney fees and expenses if they prevail in an action or proceeding to enforce their rights under that federal statute. 38 U.S.C. § 4323(h)(2). Attorney fees may be awarded in the context of a certified question, but only if the requesting party prevails. E.g., Nelson v. P.S.C., Inc., 2 Wn.3d 227, 243-44, 535 P.3d 418 (2023). 22 Bearden v. City of Ocean Shores et al. No. 103121-1 Bearden is not entitle'}, {'verified': 'false', 'canonical_citation': '197 Wash. 2d 535, 484 P.3d 1251', 'url': None, 'extracted_case_name': 'N/A', 'hinted_case_name': None, 'extracted_date': '', 'canonical_date': None, 'error': 'Citation could not be verified by any source', 'all_citations': ['197 Wash. 2d 535, 484 P.3d 1251'], 'primary_citation': '197 Wash. 2d 535, 484 P.3d 1251', 'case_name': 'N/A', 'format_analysis': {'format_type': 'valid', 'is_valid_format': True, 'is_valid_volume': True, 'error': None}, 'likelihood_score': 0.5, 'explanation': 'Citation format is valid but not found in searched databases', 'context': ''}], 'citations': [{'verified': 'false', 'canonical_citation': '200 Wash. 2d 72, 514 P.3d 643', 'url': None, 'extracted_case_name': 'N/A', 'hinted_case_name': None, 'extracted_date': '', 'canonical_date': None, 'error': 'Citation could not be verified by any source', 'all_citations': ['200 Wash. 2d 72, 514 P.3d 643'], 'primary_citation': '200 Wash. 2d 72, 514 P.3d 643', 'case_name': 'N/A', 'format_analysis': {'format_type': 'valid', 'is_valid_format': True, 'is_valid_volume': True, 'error': None}, 'likeli